# sword_of_rage_le 1.18 - worked out by the app from the ports of TMNT Pro 1.58.
# Emulator-proven 2026-09-24 by a full build check (modes/gamecheck.sh play full, item 162): the
# runtime hooked the game, 30 of its 35 shots came from their switches, a drain ended each ball, and
# the 8 events below fired where their names say (a tilted ball, three balls to the game's end).
# Shots no press made (their switch is left out of the check, or needs two): Left outlane, Right outlane, U/p lock 1, U/p lock 2, U/p lock 3.
# program sha1 5684a7e0f1ab8c55f7d7ee389923e4283907e20a, portgen revision 3, 1 reference port(s) of framework generation A.
# Callouts heard in the emulator 2026-09-24 (item 163): countdown.

game           sword_of_rage_le
version        1.18

