site hook_dispatch    0x0033e9a0 0xe35000bf 0xe92d4038
#   the end of ball: no ball_end site - the framework's end of ball at 0x27dfb8 dispatches bus 0x30 (its sequence 0x31, 0x32, 0x30, then the bonus 0x23, 0x24) - drain a ball to prove it (value ball_end_event below)
#   switch_edge: the framework's per-switch call in its switch drain (generation A: r0 = the switch id, called for every edge the game acts on, before the level is stored) - press the switches to prove it
site switch_edge      0x00131690 0xe92d4010 0xe1a04000
